  "question": {
    "text": "The value of $\\tan \\frac{\\pi}{5}+2 \\tan \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}+4 \\cot \\frac{4 \\pi}{5}$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\cot \\frac{\\pi}{5}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\cot \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\cot \\frac{4 \\pi}{5}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\cot \\frac{3 \\pi}{5}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\tan \\frac{\\pi}{5}+2 \\tan \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}+4 \\cot \\frac{4 \\pi}{5}$\r\n$=\\frac{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}+2 \\frac{\\sin \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}+4 \\frac{\\cos \\frac{4 \\pi}{5}}{\\sin \\frac{4 \\pi}{5}}$\r\n$=\\frac{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}+2 \\frac{\\sin \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}+\\frac{4\\left(\\cos ^{2} \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}-\\sin ^{2} \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}\\right)}{2 \\sin \\frac{2 \\pi}{5} \\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}$\r\n$=\\frac{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}+2 \\frac{\\sin \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}+\\frac{2\\left(\\cos ^{2} \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}-\\sin ^{2} \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}\\right)}{\\sin \\frac{2 \\pi}{5} \\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}$\r\n$=\\frac{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}+2\\left[\\frac{\\sin ^{2} \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}+\\cos ^{2} \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}-\\sin ^{2} \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{5} \\sin \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}\\right]$\r\n$=\\frac{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}+\\frac{2 \\cos \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}{\\sin \\frac{2 \\pi}{5}}$\r\n$=\\frac{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5}}{\\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}+\\frac{2\\left(\\cos ^{2} \\frac{\\pi}{5}-\\sin ^{2} \\frac{\\pi}{5}\\right)}{2 \\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5} \\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}$\r\n$=\\frac{\\sin ^{2} \\frac{\\pi}{5}+\\cos ^{2} \\frac{\\pi}{5}-\\frac{\\sin ^{2} \\pi}{5}}{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5} \\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}$\r\n$=\\frac{\\cos ^{2} \\frac{\\pi}{5}}{\\sin \\frac{\\pi}{5} \\cos \\frac{\\pi}{5}}$\r\n$=\\cot \\frac{\\pi}{5}$"
  }
